    {
      "text": "Lay out a half strip of bacon. Place a small bunch of green beans (about 6 or 7) onto the strip of bacon and roll up into a bundle. Place the bundle into the casserole dish, seam-side down. Repeat with remaining bacon strips and green beans. Sprinkle with brown sugar, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
